==Strategy==
The overall strategy is bringing some combos for money (or a rich cat) and then bursting the M. Ost down before the second one comes out, [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Future]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]] work as meatshields here, although for replays or higher difficulties, [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone]] would work. [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapsticks]] can work as a main attacker here as their strong against relics and good generalist stats can work to form a stack. [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master Uril]] can and will work as a source of crowd control vs the M. Osts, having the ability to create a surge that slows any relics it touches. Because of this, Uril will also reduce the pushing power of the M. Ost and Sir Rels, providing valuable support against pushing power as brutal as this.

==Trivia==
*A [[wikipedia:Pit-house|pithouse]] is a primitive shelter built mostly or entirely below ground and roofed over.

